From cf123eb3dde9b141c40c0d765354e36ab438a8d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WWE13 Recomp <wwe13-recomp@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:19:18 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 123/124] rate census: per-thread CPU and a main-thread sampler
 on macOS / iOS

- Per-thread CPU from Mach thread info (no /proc), converted from Mach time units, plus the
  process total and the top 8 threads.
- WWE13_MAIN_SAMPLE=1: samples the VdSwap thread 500 times a second (suspend, run state, frame
  pointer walk): running vs waiting per second, and every 5 s the most common stacks as
  main-executable offsets (symbolize with atos -l 0x100000000).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
